# Kaggle base dataset goes here (gitignored - licence-restricted, machine-local).
#
#   pip install kaggle
#   # Kaggle -> Account settings -> "Create New API Token" -> kaggle.json
#   # Windows: move kaggle.json to %USERPROFILE%\.kaggle\kaggle.json
#   kaggle datasets download -d pradumn203/payment-date-prediction-for-invoices-dataset -p data/raw/
#   # then unzip in place
#
# data/generate_dataset.py uses whatever CSV lands here as its statistical base.
# If this directory is empty it falls back to built-in distributions with a warning,
# so a fresh clone still runs.
